: A tu per tu con gli squali","language":"it-IT"},"originalTitle":"Sharks Up Close with Bertie Gregory","overview":{"value":"Il documentarista Bertie Gregory raggiunge le coste del Sudafrica per filmare i grandi squali bianchi. Immergendosi senza gabbia, osserva da vicino questi predatori e le difficoltà che devono affrontare in un mare in rapida trasformazione.","language":"it-IT"},"releaseDate":"2025-07-05","status":"Released","rating":6.9,"ratingCount":18,"genres":["Documentario","televisione film"],"countries":["United States of America","United Kingdom"],"facts":{"Runtime":"44m"},"keywords":[],"networks":[],"socialLinks":{},"cast":[{"id":3039987,"name":"Bertie Gregory","role":"Self - Host","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/33SnXfOwM7RuBnuEPf4ziqXvlF9.jpg"},{"id":6076859,"name":"Patrick Mcdonald","role":"Self - Skipper"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Bertie Gregory: A tu per tu con gli squali","overview":"Il documentarista Bertie Gregory raggiunge le coste del Sudafrica per filmare i grandi squali bianchi. Immergendosi senza gabbia, osserva da vicino questi predatori e le difficoltà che devono affrontare in un mare in rapida trasformazione."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"Bertie heads to South Africa for his most audacious mission yet. The wild waters here are a hotspot for one of the ocean’s most famous and feared predators, the great white shark. Diving in the shallows without a cage, Bertie will attempt to film these huge sharks. By entering their domain, he discovers the challenges they face on our rapidly changing planet."}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yZGkMm0mxoM0P2szW35xLYmra0I.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yZGkMm0mxoM0P2szW35xLYmra0I.png","language":"it","width":2904,"height":1299},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7klexar4wcn1vgICYjgSaXOtZLa.png","previewUrl":"https://im